A replica of the [[SR:Dragonstone|Dragonstone]], which [[SR:Farengar Secret-Fire|Farengar Secret-Fire]] sends you to retrieve during [[SR:Bleak Falls Barrow (quest)|Bleak Falls Barrow]]. Only 5,000 were produced, and each was individually numbered. The front is inscribed with a map of Skyrim's Dragon Burial Mounds. The following is inscribed on the back in [[Lore:Dragon Language|Dragon Script]]: ''Here lie our fallen lords until power of Alduin revives''.

The tablet is made of metal. The purchase included a Dragonstone replica, a stand for the replica, and a map of Skyrim.

It was available for pre-order at the Bethesda Gear Store, and was ready to ship in October of 2021.
